Absolutly loved this game! I was a big fan of Far Cry® 3, in fact, thats the first Far Cry game I ever played. This one copies a lot of the things you could do in the third one, which i'm glad, but it also adds in NEW things to do! The graphics are amazing as well as the gameplay. The missions are over whelming fun! And when you've completed the game, you can still admire the amazing scenery, and find all the hidden treasures in the island! Oh, and I can't forget to mention the easter eggs, especially in the start of the game (;
One thing I was disapointed about, is the multiplayer mode. The models are pretty crappy and the general multiplayer gameplay is pretty bad. Could've done something more creative. Other than that, I give this game a 5/5 rating!
I had to reformat my computer and forgot to save the game files. ): 10/10

